：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b0033f49bc03874b6f6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.16,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62523","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":8,"sequenceScore":-0.0327,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我正打算现在就打扫呢。","要喝点什么吗？","把房间打扫一下吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我正打算现在就打扫呢。","把房间打扫一下吧。","要喝点什么吗？"],"answer":0}]}
